    <!-- 4.7, not 4.8: the substation servers run .NET Framework 4.7, and an exe
         built for 4.8 refuses to start there before a line of it runs. The
         Microsoft.NETFramework.ReferenceAssemblies.net47 package supplies the 4.7
         reference assemblies, so this builds even where Visual Studio has no
         4.7 targeting pack installed. -->
